    <string name="settings_backup_restore">Restore from backup file…</string>
    <string name="settings_backup_note">Backs up contacts and message history only — your identity is already recoverable from your 24-word phrase, so it isn\'t included. Encrypted with a key derived from that same phrase; nothing extra to remember. Pick any folder — a synced Drive/Dropbox folder works too, since this app never talks to that service directly.</string>
